---
description: >-
  Regression test for issue #7290: a classDef applied with `:::` and with a
  `class` statement to states inside a composite state is rendered with the
  same styles as a top-level state using the same class.
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state A {
    a:::badEvent --> b
    b --> c
    class c badEvent
  }

  B:::badEvent --> [*]

  classDef badEvent fill:#f00,color:white,font-weight:bold,stroke-width:2px,stroke:yellow
